@startuml class-strategy
' UML sınıf diyagramı: Strategy deseni — sınav puanlama (#51; ADR-008).
' Sınıf, alan ve metot adları koddakiyle birebir; getter'lar gösterilmez. Tutarlılık tablosu PR #51'de.
' Render (Graphviz gerekmez, smetana yerleşimi; PNG ve SVG ayrı komutlarla):
'   java -Duser.language=en -Duser.country=US -jar plantuml.jar -tpng docs/diagrams/class-strategy.puml
'   java -Duser.language=en -Duser.country=US -jar plantuml.jar -tsvg docs/diagrams/class-strategy.puml

!pragma layout smetana
!include class-style.iuml

title Mini Udemy - Sınıf diyagramı: Strategy (ScoringStrategy) — [[../adr/0008-strategy-puanlama.md ADR-008]]

package "com.miniudemy.quiz.domain" {
  class Quiz <<entity>> {
    - id : Long
    - sectionId : Long
    - scoringType : ScoringType
    - passThreshold : int
    + changeScoringType(scoringType : ScoringType) : void
  }

  enum ScoringType {
    SINGLE_ANSWER
    MULTI_ALL_OR_NOTHING
    MULTI_PARTIAL
  }
}

package "com.miniudemy.quiz.service" {
  class QuizAttemptService <<service>> <<Context>> {
    - scoringResolver : ScoringStrategyResolver
    - events : ApplicationEventPublisher
    + listMyAttempts(quizId : Long, studentId : Long) : List<AttemptSummaryResponse>
    + submit(quizId : Long, studentId : Long, request : SubmitAttemptRequest) : AttemptResultResponse
  }

  class ScoringStrategyResolver <<component>> {
    - strategies : Map<ScoringType, ScoringStrategy> = new EnumMap<>(ScoringType.class)
    + ScoringStrategyResolver(candidates : List<ScoringStrategy>)
    + resolve(type : ScoringType) : ScoringStrategy
  }

  interface ScoringStrategy <<Strategy>> {
    + type() : ScoringType
    + score(input : ScoringInput) : QuestionScore
  }

  class SingleAnswerScoring <<component>> <<ConcreteStrategy>> {
    + type() : ScoringType
    + score(input : ScoringInput) : QuestionScore
  }

  class MultiAnswerAllOrNothing <<component>> <<ConcreteStrategy>> {
    + type() : ScoringType
    + score(input : ScoringInput) : QuestionScore
  }

  class MultiAnswerPartialScoring <<component>> <<ConcreteStrategy>> {
    + type() : ScoringType
    + score(input : ScoringInput) : QuestionScore
  }

  class ScoringInput <<record>> {
    points : int
    correctOptionIds : Set<Long>
    selectedOptionIds : Set<Long>
    --
    + correctSelectedCount() : long
    + wrongSelectedCount() : long
  }

  class QuestionScore <<record>> {
    earned : BigDecimal
    max : int
    --
    {static} + of(earned : int, max : int) : QuestionScore
  }
}

QuizAttemptService --> "1" ScoringStrategyResolver : scoringResolver
QuizAttemptService ..> Quiz : quiz.getScoringType()
QuizAttemptService ..> ScoringStrategy : strategy.score(new ScoringInput(...))
ScoringStrategyResolver o--> "3" ScoringStrategy : strategies
ScoringStrategy <|.. SingleAnswerScoring
ScoringStrategy <|.. MultiAnswerAllOrNothing
ScoringStrategy <|.. MultiAnswerPartialScoring
ScoringStrategy ..> ScoringInput
ScoringStrategy ..> QuestionScore
ScoringStrategy ..> ScoringType
Quiz --> "1" ScoringType : scoringType

note right of ScoringStrategyResolver
  Spring tüm ScoringStrategy bean'lerini verir;
  her ScoringType için tam bir strateji yoksa
  açılışta IllegalStateException.
  resolve(quiz.getScoringType()) → if/switch yok.
  Yeni kural = yeni strateji sınıfı + ScoringType değeri.
end note

note bottom of MultiAnswerPartialScoring
  SINGLE_ANSWER: seçilen = doğru → tam puan
  MULTI_ALL_OR_NOTHING: tam eşleşme → tam puan
  MULTI_PARTIAL: puan × max(0, doğru − yanlış) / doğru sayısı
end note

@enduml
